{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetExists"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.linearIndependent_xComp_mul_Tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.linearIndependent_xComp_mul_Tw","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionCosetSum.lean#L141-L162","doc":"**Mathas, Corollary 3.4** — `{x_μ T_e}` is linearly independent over any family of\nleft-distinguished representatives lying in distinct cosets. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.repr_xComp_mul_Tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.repr_xComp_mul_Tw","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionCosetSum.lean#L118-L139","doc":"**The coordinates of `x_μ T_e` in the `T_w` basis are the indicator of the coset.**\nEvery coordinate is `0` or `1`; `q` does not appear.  This is the concrete form of\nMathas' Corollary 3.4, and everything below is bookkeeping on top of it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.xComp_mul_Tw_eq_murphySum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.xComp_mul_Tw_eq_murphySum","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionCosetSum.lean#L106-L116","doc":"**The same, as a Murphy element of the coset.**  `x_μ · T_e = x_{e·S_μ}` — the\nMurphy element of the *left coset*, which is exactly Mathas' `m_{μ}T_d`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.xComp_mul_Tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.xComp_mul_Tw","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionCosetSum.lean#L94-L104","doc":"**`x_μ · T_e = Σ_{v ∈ S_μ} T_{e·v}`.**  Every coefficient is `1`; no `q` appears. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.eq_of_mul_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.eq_of_mul_mem","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionCosetSum.lean#L83-L90","doc":"**Distinct left-distinguished elements give disjoint cosets.**  Contrapositive form:\nif the cosets meet, the representatives are equal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.existsUnique_isDistinguishedL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.existsUnique_isDistinguishedL","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionCosetSum.lean#L62-L81","doc":"**Prop 3.3 transported to left cosets.**  Every left coset `w · S_μ` contains exactly\none `e` with `e⁻¹` distinguished.  Nothing new is proved here: inversion is a bijection\nbetween left and right cosets that preserves length, so\n`CompositionCosetExists.existsUnique_isDistinguished_mem_coset` transfers verbatim. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.length_mul_eq_add_of_isDistinguishedL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.length_mul_eq_add_of_isDistinguishedL","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionCosetSum.lean#L48-L60","doc":"**The length hypothesis `Tw_mul_Tw` needs**, on the left. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.IsDistinguishedL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CompositionCosetSum.IsDistinguishedL","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CompositionCosetSum.lean#L42-L46","doc":"**The left-coset form of `IsDistinguished`**: `e` is the minimal-length\nrepresentative of the *left* coset `e · S_μ` exactly when `e⁻¹` is distinguished for the\nright cosets.  See the module docstring for why the flip is forced. ","signatureChunk":0}]}